# Input

```css
@custom-theme   token;
@unknown#token{color:red;}
@unknown#{color:red;}
@unknown   token{.item{color:red;}}
@media(color){.item{color:red;}}

```


# Formatted

```css
@custom-theme token;
@unknown #token {
	color: red;
}
@unknown # {
	color: red;
}
@unknown token {
	.item {
		color: red;
	}
}
@media (color) {
	.item {
		color: red;
	}
}

```
